{
  "version": "6",
  "name": "PhysioSafe - Admision completa y triaje",
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "event-start",
      "type": "start",
      "graphCoordinates": {
        "x": 80,
        "y": 120
      },
      "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-start-intro"
    }
  ],
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": "group-bienvenida",
      "title": "Bienvenida y alcance",
      "graphCoordinates": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 80
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-intro",
          "type": "text",
          "content": {
            "richText": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Hola, soy el asistente de PhysioSafe. Voy a preparar tu admision para que el equipo tenga tus datos, el motivo de consulta y una primera orientacion antes de la cita."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "No sustituyo una valoracion sanitaria. Si tienes dolor incapacitante, fiebre, perdida de fuerza, adormecimiento progresivo o un traumatismo importante, contacta con urgencias."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-intro-consent"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-privacy-consent",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-consent-yes",
              "content": "Acepto que se usen estos datos para gestionar mi admision"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-consent-no",
              "content": "Prefiero que me contacte la clinica"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-privacy-consent"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-consent-name"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "group-identidad",
      "title": "Datos del paciente",
      "graphCoordinates": {
        "x": 760,
        "y": 80
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-name",
          "type": "text input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Nombre y apellidos",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "variableId": "var-name"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-name-phone"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-phone",
          "type": "text input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Telefono de contacto",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "variableId": "var-phone"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-phone-email"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-email",
          "type": "email input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Email",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "variableId": "var-email"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-email-contact"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-contact-preference",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-contact-phone",
              "content": "Telefono"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-contact-email",
              "content": "Email"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-contact-whatsapp",
              "content": "WhatsApp"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-contact-preference"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-contact-first-visit"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-first-visit",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-first-yes",
              "content": "Es mi primera visita"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-first-no",
              "content": "Ya he venido antes"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-first-visit"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-first-reason"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "group-clinica",
      "title": "Motivo y triaje",
      "graphCoordinates": {
        "x": 1160,
        "y": 80
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-reason",
          "type": "text input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Motivo principal de consulta",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "isLong": true,
            "variableId": "var-reason"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-reason-area"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-area",
          "type": "text input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Zona afectada",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "variableId": "var-area"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-area-duration"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-symptom-duration",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-duration-recent",
              "content": "Menos de 72 horas"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-duration-weeks",
              "content": "Varios dias o semanas"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-duration-chronic",
              "content": "Mas de un mes"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-duration-relapse",
              "content": "Es una recaida"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-symptom-duration"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-duration-pain"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-pain",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-low",
              "content": "Dolor leve"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-medium",
              "content": "Dolor moderado"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-high",
              "content": "Dolor intenso"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-none",
              "content": "No tengo dolor, busco prevencion o seguimiento"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-pain"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-pain-urgency"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-urgency",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-urgency-normal",
              "content": "Puede esperar unos dias"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-urgency-soon",
              "content": "Quiero que me valoren pronto"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-urgency-urgent",
              "content": "Necesito revision urgente"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-urgency"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-urgency-red-flags"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-red-flags",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-flag-none",
              "content": "Ninguna de estas"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-flag-neuro",
              "content": "Perdida de fuerza, hormigueo o adormecimiento progresivo"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-flag-trauma",
              "content": "Traumatismo importante o caida reciente"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-flag-fever",
              "content": "Fiebre, mal estado general o dolor nocturno intenso"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-flag-control",
              "content": "Perdida de control de esfinteres"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-red-flags"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-red-flags-previous"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-previous-treatment",
          "type": "text input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Tratamientos, pruebas o diagnosticos previos",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "isLong": true,
            "variableId": "var-previous-treatment"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-previous-insurance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "group-agenda",
      "title": "Disponibilidad y cierre",
      "graphCoordinates": {
        "x": 1560,
        "y": 80
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block-insurance",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-insurance-private",
              "content": "Particular"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-insurance-mutua",
              "content": "Seguro o mutua"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-insurance-company",
              "content": "Derivacion de empresa o club"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-insurance-unsure",
              "content": "No lo se todavia"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-insurance"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-insurance-physio-email"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-physiotherapist-email",
          "type": "email input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Email profesional del fisioterapeuta elegido",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "variableId": "var-physiotherapist-email"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-physio-email-availability"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-availability",
          "type": "choice input",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "choice-morning",
              "content": "Manana"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-afternoon",
              "content": "Tarde"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-any",
              "content": "Indiferente"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "variableId": "var-availability"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-availability-date"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-preferred-date",
          "type": "text input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Fecha preferida, por ejemplo 2026-05-20",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "variableId": "var-preferred-date"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-date-time"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-preferred-time",
          "type": "text input",
          "options": {
            "labels": {
              "placeholder": "Hora preferida, por ejemplo 10:00",
              "button": "Continuar"
            },
            "variableId": "var-preferred-time"
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-time-summary"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-summary",
          "type": "text",
          "content": {
            "richText": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Gracias. Enviaremos la admision a PhysioSafe. La ficha del paciente se creara o actualizara, y si hay un hueco real disponible se preparara una cita pendiente para que el equipo la revise."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "outgoingEdgeId": "edge-summary-end"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-end",
          "type": "text",
          "content": {
            "richText": [
              {
                "type": "p",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Proceso completado. Si has indicado alguna senal de alerta o urgencia, no esperes a la confirmacion automatica y contacta con la clinica o con urgencias segun la gravedad."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
